# Everything this lane produces is derived and large: heldout-real.jsonl alone is 152 MB.
# `out/*` rather than `out/`, because git will not re-include a file whose parent directory is
# excluded, and the two negations below have to work.
out/*

# Two exceptions, both small, both needed to check a published number without regenerating 152 MB.
# heldout-real.manifest.json records the exact head of each of the four source repositories the
# held-out set was built from, which is how the `submission/main` drift was detectable at all.
# analysis.json records the rates, the interval sweep and which added-lines function produced them.
!out/heldout-real.manifest.json
!out/analysis.json
